the talk of hunger and weight meters led me to this:

the weight meter operates like the hunger meter (using text like "trim",
"packed" and so on and no text when normally encumbered for your strength).
to make space the bottom line would have to change from:

Spy? the Enchanter St:18/** Dx:22 Co:18 In:18 Wi:14 Ch:12 Lawful S:738096
Dlvl:27 G:760 HP:115(115) Pw:80(80) AC:-40 Xp:16/369029 T:70597 Satiated

to (note that gold isn't shown and that only current Hp and Pw are shown):

Spy? the Enchanter St:18/** Dx:22 Co:18 In:18 Wi:14 Ch:12 Lawful S:738096
Dlvl:27  HP:115 Pw:80 AC:-40 Xp:16/369029 T:70597 Satiated Trim

if you want your full stats you need to use: I@ and you'd get an
inventory listing of your stats, including maximum numbers.

so what's up with the meter maid??? (thought you'd never ask ...)
"Lovely Rita" is a monster much like the mail daemon who is activated
at certain times (you'll have to figure it out).  she hits and your
bottom line (temporarily, umm 20-30 moves) changes to:

Lawful Spy? the Enchanter  S:738096 In:18 St:18/** Dx:22 Co:18 Ch:12 Wi:14
Trim  HP:115 AC:-40 Dlvl:27  Xp:16/369029 Pw:80 T:70597 Satiated

"Lovely Rita" is, of course, an officer with the interface police ...

